---
import SectionTitle from '../SectionTitle.astro';
---

<section id="about-me" class="section">
  <SectionTitle title="about-me" />
  <p class="text-primary-gray leading-6 tracking-normal sm:w-[34rem]">
    Hey there!
    <br /><br />
    I'm a software engineer with 5 years of experience, mainly focused on JavaScript technologies. Over
    the years, I've had the opportunity to work with React Native for mobile applications, React.js for
    web development, and Node.js for backend.
    <br /><br />
    I'm eager to take on new challenges that allow me to grow further, collaborate with talented teams,
    and continue to improve my skills in both front-end and back-end development
  </p>
</section>
